title: PrologueFirst
---
Long ago, the Frog Village thrived in harmony. Bubbles, a father, cherished his tadpoles and his peaceful home. But danger lurked in the shadows.  

One day, disaster struck. A vengeful alligator snapping turtle stormed the village. Once a pet, abandoned, he hated Bubbles. In a cruel act of revenge, he stole his tadpoles, forcing The Cheese King and his rat army to help.  

Now, Bubbles must face the dangers of the swamp, battling predators and pushing forward with one goal. To save his children. He won’t be alone. A trusted friend, myself, swears to help however he can.  

The fate of the village and the tadpoles now rests in your hands. 

    <<jump SwitchSceneNode>>
